                <p xml:id="del-2025-08-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-28a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-01T12:05:31.373+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】唯獨高赫未失君臣禮節。」【總結】"唯...不..."結構忠實再現，禮制用語完整保留。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-28a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-01T12:11:42.1+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【原文】子以姦事我者也。」【直譯】汝實以奸邪之道侍奉寡人。」</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0010_tls_013-28a.60" xml:lang="en" resp="#XiaoDing" modified="2025-08-01T12:42:10.344+09:00" resp-del="#XiaoDing" src-id="KR3j0010-zh-68c0e768">【直譯】此即所費寡而德澤廣之驗。【總結】判斷句擴展為九字格，百分之三十增補"之驗"強化論斷，呼應前文"用約為德"主題。</seg>
                </p>
